igure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301153583960064574910.jpeg/CyjN2uvFbd6W5-GOutkcZKNUb88NEM5XE-kB3TnpAd0\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301157006643200732891.jpeg/Xdkc3qIYhRz13lzVtx_sspnzw67W1lz2MKVyWBqlclg\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301160592904192849051.jpeg/Yo7DPglfw84YraLwXaxN3rREGPBN82UsqEBUuYJAVLk\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301163860398080417539.jpeg/z85wMrFO9bJKEI8gURrPdb5Hx7u3Frbb_WnyZNdp8mQ\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301163288793088049812.jpeg/kWzHmHdttEL06r6NKahCh1XHUnckZ3BPfkAZa1RAGWs\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301166795362304870625.jpeg/LY6izq-AtAfJ-Px8MAHgLyb1N53FA_VwVZYwRX-WMEU\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301171514085376601523.jpeg/P4adoBN2MCvGHVbs1cEZdXHFuAcOIzSWTE_NyGZPzcg\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301176614490112483097.jpeg/5oISRrsbAT23wF7-dJ3IIoL2MfXpeGDAyJWkgOKVpIA\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301181085749248245810.jpeg/VhAlFw2G7Pw-qLQvZCmPITpvCM-Ha9aJ6ixYSsAsWEo\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301185720586240613042.jpeg/7See4sTCVF6N52TtUZ7weM2pZz0eEA6OTUhozGdIaMw\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301191194284032285361.jpeg/M5YLCnvftEg9SliJZnROH0tYvFhklUq0WK7FPXKuxT0\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301196131110912108735.jpeg/gDFvFZG2zUWHLFwsBrauel4RczSMnZ22cL4XW1q-F1s\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301201021800448249157.jpeg/BV_lfhgIz8kwPuFjE1CxbiE8P0s6rgHFjWLYUqdi2FI\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774301205325287424648209.jpeg/AYVvGg7n12jSaFztajph8SHgBd4rJvWs-B3jP9Id4z8\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊睇黎彼得專訪照：</p><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774306251038265344589716.jpeg/GDlGWAjZm_e3Gl96I6y7QwMaOdDQ_1YApbGsdo-xrHY\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774306256633597952795401.jpeg/p1NSOYrJM6rCp6zCDljS_2UO4Sn-D4_NWuv1cnDr9XI\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774306261994049536318540.jpeg/tjwflcNvDC5VmtcppYiqa0vXvSOEs3aQTXQzZ2d0M2c\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774306266020712448602519.jpeg/63ABEzuOuYjNQWjZ3Oy_f2SiN2lhcx1uw7i_oum4v6I\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774306269107851264415609.jpeg/uo10VtjsxlLneKn_u-7rZyCdIZQO48Gn4WoiP8tqIj8\"/><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230824/771459607616425984281073.jpeg/lmGCqk2BnzgAD3dgy5fVUh-XVJqp-Wt94